ed any plans to break with Maduro.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"The situation in Venezuela remains extremely tense.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"Any small political miscalculation could provoke serious violence and chaos in the country.", "claim_types":["prediction"],"evidence_ids":[3]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
